                    }
                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "525890c1-a1a2-4182-874b-292ddde7787d",
                        "source_entry_id": "a1594cae-da62-3259-a3b0-e93575b6e7c9",
                        "source_sense_id": "d49fd24c-0fdb-3fb2-811c-90f61831002f",
                        "source_sense_description": "weibliche Person, die alles - besonders Zukünftiges - pessimistisch betrachtet",
                        "target_lang_word": "doomsayer",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "doomsayer",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ea25b995-9c4f-3675-9598-1be6f7790d1e",
                                        "entry_id": "13148671-2399-3f63-9554-47c51941e1cd",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who makes dire predictions about the future; one who predicts doom."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "9b304796-b122-47f4-88d6-ac54d23a1d7e",
                                                "sense_id": "ea25b995-9c4f-3675-9598-1be6f7790d1e",
                                                "text": "Even from the doomsayers you hear reflections of hope. Nobody wants \"it\" to happen. In his darkest moments, man is aware that, while he may be limited, humankind need not be."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "0e28004a-24d6-460b-8562-8138c2f09dda",
                                                "sense_id": "ea25b995-9c4f-3675-9598-1be6f7790d1e",
                                                "text": "4: THE DOOMSAYERS¶ So many people have written so many books and articles forecasting doom at the end of the twentieth century that we cannot possibly do credit to all of them here."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "67a55dd8-724b-4a22-bc6b-2e695be29010",
                                                "sense_id": "ea25b995-9c4f-3675-9598-1be6f7790d1e",
                                                "text": "He is not a doomsayer or a conspiracy theorist. A ceramist, Mr. Kunze simply inhabits a longer view of history, one in which humans are the dinosaurs, facing down a probable extinction."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "7e213911-354e-45fb-8f01-be2f152a99b3",
                                                "sense_id": "ea25b995-9c4f-3675-9598-1be6f7790d1e",
                                                "text": "Critics of the doomsayers, meanwhile, are becoming more outspoken."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "f1c5c0eb-d5ec-4381-958b-c7e36e8ddb36",
                        "source_entry_id": "a1594cae-da62-3259-a3b0-e93575b6e7c9",
                        "source_sense_id": "d49fd24c-0fdb-3fb2-811c-90f61831002f",
                        "source_sense_description": "weibliche Person, die alles - besonders Zukünftiges - pessimistisch betrachtet",
                        "target_lang_word": "naysayer",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "naysayer",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "307486b8-2610-3144-82b0-280028d84686",
                                        "entry_id": "17aaf869-eab1-3ba3-b5cf-dd238b092713",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "One who consistently denies, criticizes, or doubts; a detractor."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "445334cb-460d-4bc9-8a8c-8e42966f2ba7",
                                                "sense_id": "307486b8-2610-3144-82b0-280028d84686",
                                                "text": "He ignored the naysayers and succeeded with his idea."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2e61d341-0339-4833-81d7-c30055036af9",
                                                "sense_id": "307486b8-2610-3144-82b0-280028d84686",
                                                "text": "As for the IRP, Secretary of State Grant Shapps continues to peddle snake oil, smoke and mirrors. His reaction to near-universal IRP condemnation from politicians, local and national media, and all but a few rail specialists was to dismiss the lot of us (in the condescending and patronising tone we have now come to expect) as \"critics and naysayers\"."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "11de80b9-9aeb-4ab8-8af4-ecafc82d7c7c",
                        "source_entry_id": "a1594cae-da62-3259-a3b0-e93575b6e7c9",
